# MFC Mission Editor is real source: force its whole tree (incl. the
# *.rc resource script + the *.ico/*.bmp/*.cur it #includes) to be
# tracked, overriding the generic binary ignores above. The old bare
# `Editor` + global `*.rc` rules silently kept the editor resource
# script untracked (it builds, but LoadFrame(IDR_EDITOR_MENU) fails).
!editor/
!editor/**
data/*
!data/defs/
!data/hdr/
!data/visual_tuning.json
unpacked_data
unpacked_data--
data-orig
1033
assets
ABLT
Tools
.codelite
*.session
*.log
*.lib
*.LIB
*.so
*.a
viewer
mc2
text_tool
.ycm_extra_conf.py
.ycm_extra_conf.pyc
*.ico
# *.rc: editor/resource.rc is tracked via !editor/** above
vidcard.csv
*.s14
.gdb_history
*.old
longpath.dbg
tmp/
dump/
test_code/
test_sound/
